ity.\n\n**X-AI**\n- **Confidence interpretation:** The pipeline treats this as a very high-confidence image-based signal, but it explicitly notes that imaging analysis is **not a definitive diagnosis**.\n- **Summary:** The combined pipeline output suggests a **high likelihood of kidney tumor / kidney cancer signal** in this scan.\n- **Visual evidence:** The pipeline reports detection of a renal tumor-like region.\n- **Recommended next steps:**\n  1. Further medical evaluation with appropriate imaging/lab review\n  2. Discuss the result with a qualified clinician\n  3. Consider additional confirmatory testing if clinically appropriate\n\n**Important note**\n- This is a **preliminary tool output, not an actual diagnosis**.\n- A real diagnosis would need review by a **radiologist/urologist**, usually with the **full CT study**, radiology interpretation, and sometimes additional imaging or biopsy depending on the case.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/b0f1c107-0576-49f4-985a-1754b3411728.jpeg\n\nIf you want, I can now also turn this into a cleaner **patient-facing report** with suggested next medical steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00017a9c222671620169baccc54d7081919c67ca8ca68e1023\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":35961,"output":484,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36445,"cost":{"input":0.08990250000000001,"output":0.00726,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.09716250000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773849794837}}
